    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d599">

                <pb facs="0896" n="886" xml:id="pg886"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Marshall to Colonel Marshall S. Carter </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-11-25">25 November 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1810. Urgent reference your 86251<anchor n="97" xml:id="d599-f1"/> inform all
                    parties concerned that it is my best judgement that immediate reduction of
                    10,000 to remaining total of 5,000 is highly desirable and should be gotten
                    underway before some new incident creates impression of reduction under hostile
                    pressure. The numbers to be eliminated do little or no good and really
                    complicate the situation therefore I recommend prompt action.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d599-f1" n="97" xml:id="d599-f1-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
